# opsx-static-check infra invariants

1. Workers launch via Cursor Task enum (`registry.task_type`, primary `shell`). Never try custom `opsx-sc-*` agent names as Task `subagent_type`.
2. Check details live only in `.cursor/static-check/checks/<id>/`.
3. Composition of MODE/waves lives only in `.cursor/static-check/registry.yaml`.
4. Workers/orchestrator are READ_ONLY; no autofix; no archive `GO`/`NO_GO`; **no self-repair** of check infra during a check run.
5. Do not reintroduce a second SoT (`opsx-static-check-workers/` or fat agent copies).
6. Canonical human cmds via runner: `bash .cursor/static-check/bin/run.sh -- …`.
7. Preflight is **optional** (`PREFLIGHT` token only); default off.
8. Wave B (`pytest-full`) only if `pytest-unit` STATUS=PASS.
9. Prompt body comes from `.cursor/static-check/base/worker-prompt.md` + pack LOAD list.
10. Orchestrator **WAIT contract**: incomplete until Final report; never stop the chat after fan-out / partial WORKER READY; resume on each Task notification until all wave packets are in.
